description: Spartan Luma is global; rounded-none only on photographs.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Luma, except photos

`components.json` is `"style": "luma"`. Helm in `libs/ui` already has Luma radii. Do not restyle toward default/shadcn.

## Keep Helm radii

- Cards / buttons: `rounded-4xl`
- Inputs, selects, date triggers: `rounded-3xl`, `bg-input/50`, `border-transparent`
- Popovers: `rounded-3xl`
- Accordion: `rounded-2xl`

## Exception: photographs only

`rounded-none` is allowed on `<img>`, `NgOptimizedImage`, and surfaces that **are** the photo (mosaic, portraits, banners, `app-tour-card` / landing dest tiles). Forms, booking card, accordion, buttons, toggles stay Luma. Do not strip Helm’s own `rounded-none` on nested innards (calendar inside a popover, input-group internals).

## Do not

```html
<!-- BAD: booking / notes UI forced square -->
<section hlmCard class="rounded-none shadow-none">
<hlm-accordion class="rounded-none">
<hlm-date-picker-trigger class="... rounded-3xl bg-input/50"> <!-- double pill: class lands on host AND button -->

<!-- GOOD -->
<section hlmCard>
<hlm-accordion type="multiple">
<hlm-date-picker-trigger class="w-full">
```

Chrome for `hlm-date-picker-trigger` lives in the Helm trigger (`host: class contents` + inner button). Select-like fields use `hlm-select-trigger` classes, not `hlmBtn variant="outline"`.
